*.orig
*.rej
.cache/


# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Final safety net — anything explicitly named "private", "internal",
# "do-not-commit", or "sensitive" is blocked. If you have to name a file
# that, you already know it shouldn't be committed.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*private*
*PRIVATE*
*do-not-commit*
*DO-NOT-COMMIT*
*do_not_commit*
*sensitive*
*SENSITIVE*
*confidential*
*CONFIDENTIAL*
internal-only/
internal_only/
